{
    "title": "Opera browser with AI",
    "description": "Fast, private and user-friendly, Opera Browser is built for security on the modern mobile internet. Enjoy Free VPN, Ad Blocker, and integrated AI, plus the built-in compression technology that easily saves your data.\r\n\r\n<b>INTEGRATED AI:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd16Aria: Smart browser AI\r\n\ud83c\udf10AI webpage summaries\r\n\ud83d\udcddAI text generation\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fAI image generation\r\n\r\n<b>MORE BUILT-IN FEATURES:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeabSecure Ad Blocker\r\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fPrivate Free VPN\r\n\ud83d\udcc8Extreme data savings\r\n\ud83d\udd04Fast file-sharing\r\n\u26bdInstant live scores\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Easy customization\r\n\r\n<b>USE AI ANYWHERE</b>\r\nChat and create with AI for free. Opera\u2019s browser AI answers your questions, creates images and content, and enhances your productivity without effort.\r\n\r\n<b>BLOCK ADS EASILY</b>\r\nEnjoy a fast, smooth, ad-free internet. Opera\u2019s built-in Ad Blocker eliminates unwanted ads and pop-ups with a single easy click.\r\n\r\n<b>BROWSE PRIVATELY</b>\r\nMake public Wi-Fi private in one easy click. Opera\u2019s Free VPN encrypts your browser traffic wherever you go. It\u2019s completely free, secure and easy to use.\r\n\r\n<b>SECURE ALL YOUR DEVICES</b>\r\nVPN Pro protects your entire device no matter which application you use. Secure up to six devices easily with one VPN Pro subscription.\r\n\r\n<b>SAVE DATA AND TIME</b>\r\nBrowse longer for less. Opera Browser\u2019s compression technology delivers fast speeds and smooth page loading while saving your data.\r\n\r\n<b>SHARE FILES SECURELY</b>\r\nEasily share files, links and notes between all your mobile and desktop devices with the private and encrypted Flow feature in Opera Browser.\r\n\r\n<b>GET LIVE FOOTBALL SCORES</b>\r\nFollow your favorite teams and never miss a goal. Opera\u2019s Live Scores section delivers scores, schedules, team details and instant updates, with fast easy access.\r\n\r\n<b>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BROWSER</b>\r\nCustomize your personal browser theme, wallpaper and search engine, and dim the screen easily to protect your eyes with Dark Mode.\r\n\r\nQUESTIONS?\r\nHelp and FAQ: https://www.opera.com/help/\r\nTerms of Service: https://legal.opera.com/terms/\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://legal.opera.com/privacy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fast, private and user-friendly, Opera Browser is built for security on the modern mobile internet. Enjoy Free VPN, Ad Blocker, and integrated AI, plus the built-in compression technology that easily saves your data.<br><br><b>INTEGRATED AI:</b><br><br>\ud83e\udd16Aria: Smart browser AI<br>\ud83c\udf10AI webpage summaries<br>\ud83d\udcddAI text generation<br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fAI image generation<br><br><b>MORE BUILT-IN FEATURES:</b><br><br>\ud83d\udeabSecure Ad Blocker<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fPrivate Free VPN<br>\ud83d\udcc8Extreme data savings<br>\ud83d\udd04Fast file-sharing<br>\u26bdInstant live scores<br>\ud83c\udfa8Easy customization<br><br><b>USE AI ANYWHERE</b><br>Chat and create with AI for free. Opera\u2019s browser AI answers your questions, creates images and content, and enhances your productivity without effort.<br><br><b>BLOCK ADS EASILY</b><br>Enjoy a fast, smooth, ad-free internet. Opera\u2019s built-in Ad Blocker eliminates unwanted ads and pop-ups with a single easy click.<br><br><b>BROWSE PRIVATELY</b><br>Make public Wi-Fi private in one easy click. Opera\u2019s Free VPN encrypts your browser traffic wherever you go. It\u2019s completely free, secure and easy to use.<br><br><b>SECURE ALL YOUR DEVICES</b><br>VPN Pro protects your entire device no matter which application you use. Secure up to six devices easily with one VPN Pro subscription.<br><br><b>SAVE DATA AND TIME</b><br>Browse longer for less. Opera Browser\u2019s compression technology delivers fast speeds and smooth page loading while saving your data.<br><br><b>SHARE FILES SECURELY</b><br>Easily share files, links and notes between all your mobile and desktop devices with the private and encrypted Flow feature in Opera Browser.<br><br><b>GET LIVE FOOTBALL SCORES</b><br>Follow your favorite teams and never miss a goal. Opera\u2019s Live Scores section delivers scores, schedules, team details and instant updates, with fast easy access.<br><br><b>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BROWSER</b><br>Customize your personal browser theme, wallpaper and search engine, and dim the screen easily to protect your eyes with Dark Mode.<br><br>QUESTIONS?<br>Help and FAQ: https://www.opera.com/help/<br>Terms of Service: https://legal.opera.com/terms/<br>Privacy Policy: https://legal.opera.com/privacy/",
